Package: syslinuxos-network-neighbors
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Franco Conidi <fconidi@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec
Suggests: lldpd
Description: Graphical viewer for directly connected LLDP neighbors
 Shows the local interface, neighbor name, remote port and LLDP details.
 Reads an existing lldpd service without changing network configuration.
